{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2019-11-25 22:30:00', 'title': 'AIR PRODUCTS DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON FEBRUARY 10, 2020', 'text': 'THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF AIR PRODUCTS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.16 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON FEBRUARY 10, 2020 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JANUARY 2, 2020.'}